### Server health
GET {{host}}/v1/health


### Get Movies
GET {{host}}/v1/movies/5

### Create Movie
POST {{host}}/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Super Mario",
  "runtime": 90,
  "year": 2021,
  "genres": ["Animated", "Comedy"]
}

### Update Movie
PATCH {{host}}/v1/movies/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "runtime": 110,
  "year": 2024
}